# Line endings for the files a *program* compares byte for byte.
#
# `npm run types:check` (frontend/scripts/generate-api-types.mjs) regenerates
# the OpenAPI snapshot and the types from the live backend and fails CI when
# either differs from what is committed — that is the F03/F17 type-drift gate.
# The generator writes LF, so on a Windows checkout with `core.autocrlf=true`
# the working copy comes back CRLF and the gate reports drift that does not
# exist. These two are generated artefacts, never hand-edited, and are pinned to
# LF everywhere so the comparison means what it says.
frontend/openapi.json text eol=lf
frontend/src/lib/api-types.ts text eol=lf
